                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The title already did the explanation for this game.\nYou are controlling a Hypership that is out of control. (Yep you read it right, controlling something that is out of control.)\n\nI can't say this game is in a category of Shoot 'Em Up since it doesn't really require you to shoot things. (There are many undestructable object).\nYour job is to evade all the objects and make your way throughout the waves.\nThe game itself is fast paced. you start with a normal speed and the speed will keep on increasing every seconds.\nIt will only dropped if you're dead.\n\nConsidering the price, it's also not a bad game for a quick entertainment.",
